  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Egypt Child Labor Prevention Grant</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot; The strategic objective will be achieved as follows: Working children will have access to education and health services; and potential child laborers will be identified for integration into schools. Child employers will be provided adequate knowledge on safety measurements and safety requirements in the work place and potential harms of child labor. Families will be identified for expanding access to existing microfinance or safety net schemes conditional on school enrollment of their children. Capacity and knowledge of local NGOs and local education and health authorities will be increased to build on this experience and manage larger scale projects in other governorates. Relevant lessons from this community based &quot;&quot;bottom up&quot;&quot; approach will be shared widely with key government authorities and decision makers to allow for targeted, sustainable interventions.&quot;</narrative>
  </description>
